    <title>Azure/azure-sdk-for-net - Releases - 2026-07-27</title>
    <id>https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net#2026-07-27</id>
    <link href="https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net" />
    <updated>2026-07-28T00:21:46Z</updated>
    <content type="html">
                &lt;div&gt;
                    
                        &lt;article&gt;
                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net/releases/tag/Azure.Monitor.OpenTelemetry.AspNetCore_1.6.0"&gt;Azure.Monitor.OpenTelemetry.AspNetCore_1.6.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;1.6.0 (2026-07-27)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Bugs Fixed&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hardened Azure Monitor ingestion and Live Metrics redirect handling to prevent credentials and telemetry from being forwarded to untrusted destinations.&lt;br&gt;
(&lt;a href="https://github.com/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net/pull/61244" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/Azure/azure-sdk-for-net/pull/61244/hovercard"&gt;#61244&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Other Changes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Updated &lt;code&gt;Azure.Monitor.OpenTelemetry.Exporter&lt;/code&gt; dependency to &lt;code&gt;1.8.3&lt;/code&gt;, which brings: customer SDK stats enabled by default (opt out with &lt;code&gt;APPLICATIONINSIGHTS_SDKSTATS_DISABLED=true&lt;/code&gt;), internal Network SDK statistics signals, GenAI agent attribution processors for spans and logs, and &lt;code&gt;CategoryName&lt;/code&gt; added to custom event custom dimensions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
                            &lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;/article&gt;
                    
                &lt;/div&gt;
            </content>
